= Slippage — Technical =

Let p_q denote a quote-time benchmark and p_e the realized execution price under a chosen sign convention. Slippage can be expressed as a signed or absolute relative deviation (p_e-p_q)/p_q. Attribution requires separating own-order price impact from intervening market movement, fees, and transaction-order effects.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* slippage ≠ price impact
* slippage tolerance ≠ realized slippage
* slippage ≠ fee

